Item.ЛокальноеУсловноеОформление.Title=The current element has its own conditional (for formatting the entries displayed in the element)
Item.ЛокальныеВыбранныеПоля.Title=The current element has its own settings for the selected fields (for detailed configuration of the element)
Item.ЛокальныеПараметрыВывода.Title=The current element has its own advanced settings
Item.ЛокальныйОтбор.Title=The current element has its own selection (to filter the records displayed in the element)
Item.ЛокальныйПорядок.Title=The current element has its own sorting (to arrange the records displayed in the element)
Item.НадписьЛокальногоОтбора.Title=In the current element, selection is not set.\nSelect a report in the structure tree to edit the selection of the report as a whole.\nIf you want the current item to have its own selection, select the check box above the text.
Item.НадписьЛокальногоПорядка.Title=No sorting is set in the current item.\nSelect a report in the structure tree to edit the sorting of the report as a whole.\nIf you want the current item to have its own sorting, select the check box above the text.
Item.НадписьЛокальногоУсловногоОформления.Title=The current element does not have a conditional set.\nSelect a report in the structure tree to edit the conditional appearance of the report as a whole.\nIf you want the current item to have its own conditional, select the check box above the text.
Item.НадписьЛокальныхВыбранныхПолей.Title=The selected fields for the current item will be automatically generated based on the selected fields of the entire report.\nSelect the report element in the structure tree to edit its selected fields.\nIf you want the current item to have selected fields that are different from the selected report fields, select the check box above the text.
Item.НадписьЛокальныхПараметровВывода.Title=No advanced settings are set in the current item.\nSelect a report in the structure tree to edit additional settings for the report as a whole.\nIf you want the current item to have its own advanced settings, select the check box above the text.
Item.НадписьНедоступногоОтбора.Title=The current element cannot be selected.\nSelect a report in the structure tree to edit the selection of the report as a whole.
Item.НадписьНедоступногоПорядка.Title=The current item cannot be sorted.\nSelect a report in the structure tree to edit the sorting of the report as a whole.
Item.НадписьНедоступногоУсловногоОформления.Title=The current element cannot have a conditional set.\nSelect a report in the structure tree to edit the conditional appearance of the report as a whole.
Item.НадписьНедоступныхВыбранныхПолей.Title=The current item cannot have the selected fields set.\nSelect the report element in the structure tree to edit its selected fields.
Item.НадписьНедоступныхПараметровВывода.Title=The current item cannot have any advanced settings.\nSelect a report in the structure tree to edit additional settings for the report as a whole.
Item.НадписьНедоступныхПолейГруппировки.Title=The current item cannot contain grouping fields.\nIn the structure tree, select the grouping for which you want to view or change the composition of the grouping fields.
Item.ПереходКВыбраннымПолямОтчета.Title=Click here to go to the selected report fields.
